/**
 * The Android app's fingerprint guide pictures (res/drawable/right_slap.png
 * and friends), reduced to a small palette and held here as data rather than
 * as image files. A development build fetches image files from the Mac, which
 * the phone cannot reach while it is on the scanner's own Wi-Fi; held this
 * way the pictures always show. Generated from assets/images/fingerGuide.
 */
